Pragmatica Monorepo — License Map
==================================

This repository contains modules under two different licenses. Each module's
license is authoritative; the per-file SPDX header and/or module-level LICENSE
file governs that module's terms.

Summary
-------

Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0):
    core/
    integrations/
    jbct/                           — except jbct/slice-processor/ and
                                       jbct/slice-processor-tests/ (see below)
    examples/                       — reference user code; authored under Apache-2.0

Business Source License 1.1 (see aether/LICENSE):
    aether/                         — full BSL 1.1 text in aether/LICENSE
    jbct/slice-processor/           — Aether tooling; BSL per module LICENSE
    jbct/slice-processor-tests/     — tests for the above; BSL per module LICENSE

